# Direct dependency of the `release-docs-gate` job in .gitlab-ci.yml (T739, plan-136): the CommonMark parser that
# scripts/verify-release-docs.py reads a release document's Migration Guide with. `requirements-release.txt` is the
# hash-locked output and the only file that job installs
# (`pip install --require-hashes --only-binary=:all: -r ci/requirements-release.txt`). Regenerate with:
#   uv pip compile ci/requirements-release.in --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes --exclude-newer <UTC timestamp> -o ci/requirements-release.txt
# <UTC timestamp> is a cooldown (SEC-T676-14; docs/wiki/mcp-pin-bump-checklist.md, section "CI Python lock files").
# Keep the versions of ci/requirements-ci.txt: tests/functional/test_ci_hash_pins.py fails when they differ.
markdown-it-py
